;; repro-01 (P3.2): term/size off a TTY. Native lg run headless (the oracle):
;;   nil
;; backend before the fix (run.mjs reported 80x24, rt's twin mirrors
;; term_wasm.go, which never returns nil):
;;   [80 24]
;; xsofy keys its descend title card on (term/size), so every descend wrote
;; ANSI escapes to stdout under the backend only (seeds 7/9/10, deep keys).
;; Fix: run.mjs reports term.size (-1, -1) = no terminal; lw-ext/term-size-v
;; maps that to nil.
(require '[term])
(println (pr-str (term/size)))
